TEXT" "AFTER THE" "DISAPPEARANCE" "OF HIS MENTOR," "DR. NITRUS BRIO" "REDISCOVERED HIS" "FIRST LOVE:" "TENDING" "BAR" "DR. NEO CORTEX" "THE WORLD HAS" "HEARD NOTHING" "MORE OF CORTEX" "SINCE CRASH" "FOILED HIS PLANS..." "BUT EVIL GENIUSES" "ARE HARDER TO" "SQUASH THAN" "COCKROACHES." "ROO" "AFTER INTENSE" "THERAPY AND EIGHT" "YEARS OF HIGHER" "EDUCATION, DR. ROO" "WENT ON TO" "WRITE THE WELL" "RECEIVED BOOK" "THROUGH THE EYE" "OF THE VORTEX:" "A STUDY OF RAPID" "EVOLUTION AND ITS" "CONSEQUENCES" "PINSTRIPE" "PINSTRIPE MOVED" "TO CHICAGO," "WHERE HE NOW OWNS" "AND OPERATES A" "CITY WIDE SANITATION" "COMPANY." "HE IS SAVING MONEY" "FOR HIS UPCOMING" "GUBERNATORIAL" "CAMPAIGN." "KONG" "KOALA KONG MOVED" "TO HOLLYWOOD" "AND LANDED A" "MOTION PICTURE" "DEAL OF UNIVERSAL" "PROPORTIONS." "CURRENTLY HE IS" "WORKING WITH A" "SPEECH THERAPIST" "TO IMPROVE HIS" "DICTION."))
